From: u8aa9b8cc06fdc99c at groups.google.com (Bob Carpenter)
Date: Tue, 03 Feb 2015 08:01:28 +0000
Subject: Re: [stan-dev] Parallelizing individual chains
Message-ID: <6WwBZHDy7Ek.4wzB7NwTGgcJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <6WwBZHDy7Ek.JuUDXoyHPMwJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
