References: <W4voz8g2Vm0.9nZKQxm_sOUJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com> <W4voz8g2Vm0.b-Cj2oFmk-cJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/stan-dev/c/W4voz8g2Vm0/m/uZl3e2L86bsJ>
