With Cholesky
 - sampling is slow
 - N_eff/N is close to 100%
 - N_eff/s<1.7e-02
Without Cholesky
 - sampling is fast, but there is much variation between chains
 - N_eff/N is about 1%
 - N_eff/s<4e-04
 - looking at trends, it's obvious that there is really really bad mixing

Aki

